{"s":93,"v":[{"t":"By the morning brightness","w":[["وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","By the morning brightness","wal-ḍuḥā","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["ضُّحَىٰ",1180]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,","w":[["وَٱلَّيْلِ","And the night","wa-al-layli","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["سَجَىٰ","it covers with darkness","sajā",""]]},{"t":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muḥammad], nor has He detested [you].","w":[["مَا","Not","mā",""],["وَدَّعَكَ","has forsaken you","waddaʿaka","",[["وَدَّعَ",4620],["كَ",18]]],["رَبُّكَ","your Lord","rabbuka","",[["رَبُّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["وَمَا","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["قَلَىٰ","He is displeased","qalā",""]]},{"t":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","w":[["وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","And surely the Hereafter","walalākhiratu","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["لْ",2],["ـَٔاخِرَةُ",89]]],["خَيْرٌۭ","(is) better","khayrun",""],["لَّكَ","for you","laka","",[["لَّ",8],["كَ",18]]],["مِنَ","than","mina",""],["ٱلْأُولَىٰ","the first","l-ūlā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أُولَىٰ",155]]]]},{"t":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied.","w":[["وَلَسَوْفَ","And soon","walasawfa","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["سَوْفَ",290]]],["يُعْطِيكَ","will give you","yuʿ'ṭīka","",[["يُعْطِي",947],["كَ",18]]],["رَبُّكَ","your Lord","rabbuka","",[["رَبُّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","then you will be satisfied","fatarḍā","",[["فَ",7],["تَرْضَىٰٓ",319]]]]},{"t":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?","w":[["أَلَمْ","Did not","alam","",[["أَ",31],["لَمْ",44]]],["يَجِدْكَ","He find you","yajid'ka","",[["يَجِدْ",127],["كَ",18]]],["يَتِيمًۭا","an orphan","yatīman",""],["فَـَٔاوَىٰ","and give shelter","faāwā","",[["فَ",7],["ـَٔاوَىٰ",868]]]]},{"t":"And He found you lost and guided [you],","w":[["وَوَجَدَكَ","And He found you","wawajadaka","",[["وَ",1],["وَجَدَ",127],["كَ",18]]],["ضَآلًّۭا","lost","ḍāllan",""],["فَهَدَىٰ","so He guided","fahadā","",[["فَ",7],["هَدَىٰ",96]]]]},{"t":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient.","w":[["وَوَجَدَكَ","And He found you","wawajadaka","",[["وَ",1],["وَجَدَ",127],["كَ",18]]],["عَآئِلًۭا","in need","ʿāilan",""],["فَأَغْنَىٰ","so He made self-sufficient","fa-aghnā","",[["فَ",7],["أَغْنَىٰ",280]]]]},{"t":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","w":[["فَأَمَّا","So as for","fa-ammā","",[["فَ",7],["أَمَّا",224]]],["ٱلْيَتِيمَ","the orphan","l-yatīma","",[["ٱلْ",2],["يَتِيمَ",463]]],["فَلَا","then (do) not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["تَقْهَرْ","oppress","taqhar",""]]},{"t":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","w":[["وَأَمَّا","And as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["ٱلسَّآئِلَ","one who asks","l-sāila","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّآئِلَ",1071]]],["فَلَا","then (do) not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["تَنْهَرْ","repel","tanhar",""]]},{"t":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["بِنِعْمَةِ","(the) Favor","biniʿ'mati","",[["بِ",10],["نِعْمَةِ",247]]],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["فَحَدِّثْ","narrate","faḥaddith","",[["فَ",7],["حَدِّثْ",1779]]]]}]}